ard_spec_ac_097", "label": "AC-097 \u2014 O percentual \u00e9 calculado na tela", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".spec/features/dashboard/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "investido zero vira travess\u00e3o e nunca zero por cento, porque zero por cento afirmaria um resultado que n\u00e3o existe"}, {"id": "_spec_features_dashboard_spec_ac_098", "label": "AC-098 \u2014 Moeda sem carteira n\u00e3o vira bloco zerado", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".spec/features/dashboard/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_dashboard_spec_ac_099", "label": "AC-099 \u2014 Investidor sem carteiras encontra o primeiro passo", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".spec/features/dashboard/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_dashboard_spec_ac_100", "label": "AC-100 \u2014 Cada bloco carrega e aparece por conta pr\u00f3pria", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".spec/features/dashboard/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_dashboard_spec_ac_101", "label": "AC-101 \u2014 Falha em uma carteira n\u00e3o derruba a tela", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".spec/features/dashboard/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_dashboard_spec_ac_102", "label": "AC-102 \u2014 Total parcial nunca se passa por total completo", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".spec/features/dashboard/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_dashboard_spec_ac_103", "label": "AC-103 \u2014 Falha ao listar as carteiras impede o consolidado inteiro", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".spec/features/dashboard/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_dashboard_spec_ac_104", "label": "AC-104 \u2014 Nenhum n\u00famero aparece sem o hor\u00e1rio da cota\u00e7\u00e3o que o gerou", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".spec/features/dashboard/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_dashboard_spec_ac_105", "label": "AC-105 \u2014 Consolidado com cota\u00e7\u00e3o defasada \u00e9 sinalizado", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".spec/features/dashboard/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "limiar por fonte \u2014 trinta minutos para BR e cinco para US \u2014 e o aviso n\u00e3o \u00e9 comunicado apenas por cor"}, {"id": "_spec_features_dashboard_spec_ac_106", "label": "AC-106 \u2014 O gr\u00e1fico mostra compras e vendas do hist\u00f3rico", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".spec/features/dashboard/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "n\u00e3o h\u00e1 s\u00e9rie de evolu\u00e7\u00e3o de cota\u00e7\u00e3o ou patrim\u00f4nio porque o backend n\u00e3o fornece esse dado"}, {"id": "_spec_features_dashboard_spec_ac_107", "label": "AC-107 \u2014 Compra e venda se distinguem sem depender de cor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".spec/features/dashboard/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_dashboard_spec_ac_108", "label": "AC-108 \u2014 Investidor sem movimenta\u00e7\u00f5es v\u00ea um estado vazio, n\u00e3o um eixo vazio", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".spec/features/dashboard/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_dashboard_spec_ac_109", "label": "AC-109 \u2014 Uma falha no hist\u00f3rico pode ser tentada novamente", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".spec/features/dashboard/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_dashboard_spec_ac_110", "label": "AC-110 \u2014 As duas telas do dashboard se alcan\u00e7am", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".spec/features/dashboard/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_dashboard_spec_consolidado_por_moeda", "label": "Consolidado por moeda montado no cliente", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".spec/features/dashboard/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "o backend n\u00e3o tem endpoint de agregado, ent\u00e3o o consolidado custa uma consulta de carteiras mais uma por carteira e \u00e9 montado no cliente; sem convers\u00e3o cambial, os totais ficam lado a lado por moeda e nunca somados"}, {"id": "_spec_features_dashboard_spec_separacao_em_duas_telas", "label": "Separa\u00e7\u00e3o do dashboard em duas telas", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".spec/features/dashboard/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "separar /dashboard de /dashboard/aportes n\u00e3o \u00e9 organiza\u00e7\u00e3o: evita que quem s\u00f3 quer o saldo pague por uma consulta que n\u00e3o pediu, e faz com que uma falha no hist\u00f3rico n\u00e3o alcance os valores do consolidado por estrutura, n\u00e3o por tratamento de erro"}, {"id": "_spec_features_dashboard_spec_asm_024", "label": "ASM-024 \u2014 Uma p\u00e1gina grande de carteiras basta para o consolidado", "file_ty